@startuml 05-shift-handover-activity
' SRS 2.5 Shift Handover - UC60 Handover Shift
title Shift Handover (Cashier closes shift - Admin reviews)

|Admin|
start
:Assign Cashier to a shift (Work Schedules) + enter opening cash;
:Check in -> schedule becomes PRESENT;
|Cashier|
:Sell during the shift (counter orders);
:End of shift: open "Close shift";
|System|
:Summarize SUCCESS payments handled by the Cashier\nfrom check-in time to now:\n- cash (CASH)\n- bank transfer / VNPAY / MoMo (reference only);
:Expected cash = opening cash + cash sales;
|Cashier|
:Count the drawer, enter actual cash (multiple of 1,000) + note;
|System|
:Difference = actual - expected (Balanced / Surplus / Shortage);
if (Difference is not 0 and no note?) then (yes)
  :Show "please enter an explanation note";
  stop
endif
if (Shift still PRESENT and belongs to this Cashier?) then (no)
  :Show "Shift already closed", nothing saved;
  stop
endif
:In 1 transaction:\n- work_schedules -> COMPLETED, check-out time, ending cash\n- INSERT shift_handovers (SUBMITTED);
:Show handover record "Waiting for Admin review";

repeat
  |Admin|
  :Open "Shift Handovers", filter "Pending";
  :Review opening cash, cash sales, expected, actual,\ndifference, Cashier's note;
  if (Figures acceptable?) then (yes)
    :Confirm (comment optional);
    |System|
    :shift_handovers -> CONFIRMED,\nsave reviewer + time;
    break
  else (no)
    |Admin|
    :Reject + enter reason (required);
    |System|
    :shift_handovers -> REJECTED,\nsave reviewer + reason;
    |Cashier|
    :View rejection reason, enter explanation;
    :Resubmit handover record;
    |System|
    :shift_handovers -> SUBMITTED (note = new explanation);
  endif
repeat while (Record pending review?) is (yes)
|Cashier|
:Sees record "Confirmed";
stop
@enduml
